Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Xx &
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.92,0:00:10.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ge
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.46,0:00:17.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,tiers
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.96,0:01:37.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We got away from Etemon, but not for long.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.94,0:01:42.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wanted us to be ready, and knowing the\Ncrest and tags could create a Digivolve,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.08,0:01:45.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I tried to give as much energy\Nto Agumon as he could take.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.20,0:01:46.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But things didn't go so well.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.02,0:01:49.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Etemon attacked us with an evil Greymon,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.28,0:01:52.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and when my guy tried to fight,\Nhe was just too full of food.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.68,0:01:54.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's when I made a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.14,0:01:55.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I forced him to Digivolve again.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.04,0:01:59.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He turned into SkullGreymon\Nand defeated the evil Greymon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.48,0:02:00.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but then he turned on us.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.10,0:02:04.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thankfully, he ran out of energy\Nand returned to a Koromon state.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.28,0:02:05.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll never do that again.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:08.48,0:02:14.98,Sign,,0,0,300,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}{\fad(300,0)}{\fs30\b1}The Illusionary Ship's Captain, Cockatrimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.72,0:02:18.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, so I may have made a\Nslight mistake, and who hasn't?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.58,0:02:21.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that techno-doofus Etemon nailed\Nus big time with that other Greymon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.06,0:02:26.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our Greymon used up so much energy fighting\Nhim, he did evolve back into Koromon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.26,0:02:30.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, this desert is so hot, even\Na lizard would need sunscreen.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.12,0:02:32.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sora, can you carry me?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.08,0:02:34.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not even.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.02,0:02:38.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The crew cut would look nice\Non you, and it's cooler.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.18,0:02:40.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do I look fat?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.26,0:02:42.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, you look hot,\Nespecially with a fur coat.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.04,0:02:44.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That thing really needs a zipper.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.88,0:02:47.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or maybe just removable shirt sleeves.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.40,0:02:48.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, how about resting our feet?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.86,0:02:50.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no place to\Nsit except on a cactus.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.96,0:02:52.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great view up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.52,0:02:53.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Next time I ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.18,0:02:55.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You look terrible, Koromon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.30,0:03:00.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If only I hadn't acted like such a\Nbonehead, you never would have digivolved.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.66,0:03:03.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't be so hard on yourself,\Nalthough come to think of it,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.28,0:03:05.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you really have made a\Nsuper icky mess of things.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.82,0:03:06.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Mimi.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.10,0:03:08.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, don't mention it, Tai.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.72,0:03:11.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm glad to help with the\Npep talk now and then.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.32,0:03:12.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.48,0:03:21.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I haven't sweated this much\Nsince Chair Leader triumphs.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.36,0:03:26.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Koromon doesn't look so good I'm\Nworried You know what we need right
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.30,0:03:30.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,now is a whole bunch of shade A\Nbig umbrella or a really big tree
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.80,0:03:33.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or maybe I could grow\Ninto a giant cactus And
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.66,0:03:36.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,smile down onto all of\Nyou As I provide cool,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.16,0:03:39.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Refreshing comfort. It's\Nofficial. The sun has just
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.40,0:03:44.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Turned Palmon's brain into a French\Nfry. Earth to Palmon, come in!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.80,0:03:45.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Palmon?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.42,0:03:47.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.12,0:03:49.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wowie, I did that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.02,0:03:53.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gee, I'm pretty amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.00,0:03:55.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you better believe it, Palmon!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.82,0:03:58.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, everybody, let's\Nhead for some shade!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.68,0:04:05.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.56,0:04:11.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happened to the shade?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.68,0:04:19.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was just a mirage, we've been tricked
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.62,0:04:22.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.60,0:04:27.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, it's about time you got here. And\Nwe're just about ready to give up on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.98,0:04:29.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Gennai.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.34,0:04:33.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gennai!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.25,0:04:35.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we found the tags and a couple of crests
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.18,0:04:37.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,like you wanted But when\Nwe got into trouble,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.18,0:04:39.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,our Digimon couldn't\NDigivolve They ended up worse
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.86,0:04:42.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,off than when they started\NTake a look at poor Agumon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.82,0:04:45.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He is just not himself, and\NI'm supposed to be helping him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.06,0:04:48.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think those thingies are more\Ntrouble than they're worth.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.74,0:04:49.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Calm down, kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.02,0:04:50.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.70,0:04:54.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The tags and crests are\Nextremely important.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.36,0:04:57.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please make sure no one\Nelse gets a hold of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.18,0:04:58.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In the end,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.09,0:05:02.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you shall see that they will work\Ntogether to help you create total harmony.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.06,0:05:03.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In English?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.70,0:05:05.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.88,0:05:08.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After all, I'm the floating, glowing guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.16,0:05:10.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As for Koromon,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.40,0:05:12.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he wouldn't be so helpless if you\Nhad known how to care for him in the
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.06,0:05:17.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,proper way But I did the best I could\NPatience is what you need to learn,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.10,0:05:21.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,my friends, and you will learn it in\Ntime But I want to have Agumon back now
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.72,0:05:23.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm starting to lose my connection
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.10,0:05:28.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's something you're going to have\Nto figure out all by yourself, good luck
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.16,0:05:31.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute Sorry,\NI'm on a tight schedule
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.14,0:05:37.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It never fails, every time I need to know\Nabout something, he hangs me out to dry
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.36,0:05:40.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are we being cared for properly?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.52,0:05:43.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we were, Agumon wouldn't\Nhave digivolved backwards.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.78,0:05:45.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, don't freak me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.98,0:05:47.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm better with computers.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.70,0:05:48.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.74,0:05:50.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As far as I'm concerned, you're the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.94,0:05:52.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You look bummed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.54,0:05:54.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How am I supposed to take care of you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.28,0:05:55.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is there a handbook somewhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.72,0:05:57.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel very inadequate. Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.98,0:06:00.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.32,0:06:07.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that a battleship? Could be.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.32,0:06:10.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it looks more like\Na fancy cruise ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.02,0:06:14.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The passengers will want their\Nmoney back when they see this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.38,0:06:16.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it could be just a mirage.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.00,0:06:18.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it looks pretty real to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.98,0:06:28.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ahoy!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.22,0:06:32.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Numemon!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.12,0:06:40.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, fella, could all of us\Ncome aboard and freshen up?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.78,0:06:45.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you don't mind, this\Nneeds a woman's touch
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.98,0:06:46.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.89,0:06:49.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,hey there, big boy Your ship looks so,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.76,0:06:53.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so inviting How about letting us on\Nboard so that we can check it out?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.26,0:06:55.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, please
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.74,0:07:06.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it safe?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.66,0:07:14.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.57,0:07:16.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No linen tablecloths?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.18,0:07:18.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I guess we can rough it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.98,0:07:20.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.04,0:07:22.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, we can take a shower.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.30,0:07:24.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm in heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.18,0:07:27.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can spend hours just\Npampering ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.70,0:07:28.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Totally, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.98,0:07:30.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we were getting pretty smelly.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.00,0:07:31.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.91,0:07:34.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They've even got little tiny soap bars.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.14,0:07:36.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Check out the incredible spread.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.18,0:07:37.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It appears to be highly edible.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.82,0:07:41.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Might I propose we eat a bit\Nand take the leftovers with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.24,0:07:43.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's eat it all now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.56,0:07:47.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I can't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.32,0:07:50.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remember when the food\Nwas just an illusion?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.76,0:07:51.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Another alien plot?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.26,0:07:55.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It doesn't smell like an alien plot
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.36,0:07:57.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.44,0:08:05.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After extensive deliberation,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.10,0:08:06.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've come to the\Nconclusion that it would be
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.36,0:08:09.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,rude to allow this cuisine\Nto become cold Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.38,0:08:11.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go for it, guys! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.60,0:08:30.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm confused Joe What do you think Gennai\Nmeant when he said We weren't taking proper
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.44,0:08:35.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Care of our Digimon? I don't know. We've\Ndone everything but give him an allowance.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.96,0:08:42.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aha I see a couple have taken the bait
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.44,0:08:49.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time for me to get started.\NThey'll never forget this cruise.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.98,0:08:54.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm Cockatrimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.02,0:08:57.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My cock-a-doodle-doo\Nwill blow to eardrums!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:56.22,0:09:05.23,Sign,,0,170,110,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Cockatrimon
Dialogue: 1,0:08:56.22,0:09:05.23,Sign,,350,0,200,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Adult
Dialogue: 1,0:08:56.22,0:09:05.23,Sign,,350,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Giant Bird Digimon
Dialogue: 1,0:08:56.22,0:09:05.23,Sign,,350,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Type
Dialogue: 1,0:08:56.22,0:09:05.23,Sign,,350,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Data
Dialogue: 1,0:08:56.22,0:09:05.23,Sign,,350,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Special Attack
Dialogue: 1,0:08:56.22,0:09:05.23,Sign,,350,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Petrifier
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.96,0:09:00.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mess with me and you'll\Nbe packed into surrender!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.06,0:09:08.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Etemon will reward me\Ngreatly when he learns
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.32,0:09:10.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've trapped the Digidestined on my ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.90,0:09:33.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Step it up, fools.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.18,0:09:35.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm getting very impatient here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.60,0:09:36.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Know what I mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.56,0:09:39.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If my network's offline,\Nthen everybody crashes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.18,0:09:40.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me tell you why.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.08,0:09:42.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because I'm Antimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.22,0:09:45.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't want to make something of it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.16,0:09:45.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.38,0:10:16.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So who gave you permission\Nto dance? Now y'all
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.50,0:10:19.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,get back to work before\Ni get myself upset again
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.90,0:10:28.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,something's wrong edemon's\Nnetwork appears to
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.12,0:10:31.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,be down ah who needs him\Ni'll have the pleasure
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.66,0:10:36.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of plastering their\Nfeathers all by myself it's
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.62,0:10:39.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,amazing how my brain\Nsurpassed my good looks
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.14,0:10:44.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,now hear this i have an important\Nmessage for you listen up
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.42,0:10:48.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the deal, I'll give you\Nan extra serving of dried bread,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.50,0:10:51.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and even throw in some jelly\Nif you capture those kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.92,0:10:57.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They need me! Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.36,0:11:00.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you know I'm claustrophobic?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.36,0:11:02.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's got me to be Numemon?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.54,0:11:03.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joe!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.34,0:11:06.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, you ask for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.36,0:11:07.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fishy dishes!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.26,0:11:14.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You better keep your hands off!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.20,0:11:15.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digivolve!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.14,0:11:16.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.74,0:11:22.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon, digital monsters,\NDigimon are the grumpels.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.88,0:11:26.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon, digital monsters,\NDigimon are the grumpels.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.72,0:11:29.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Koromon, Digivolve, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.06,0:11:31.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Agumon!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.98,0:11:36.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow! He's back! Wow! Pepperbred!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.10,0:11:37.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hi!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.66,0:11:39.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.94,0:11:41.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That bad egg is Cockatrimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.20,0:11:44.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Petra, fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.76,0:11:53.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Poor Agumon! Gomamon!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.16,0:11:55.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, they left me a present!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.38,0:12:04.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're sunk without these,\Nbut I wouldn't be too upset.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.84,0:12:08.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you've got yourself a couple\Nof nice Digimon garden ornaments!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.84,0:12:35.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Blue Blaster
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.38,0:12:41.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Super Shocker
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.08,0:12:43.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bubble blow!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.06,0:12:46.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's your turn! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.34,0:12:48.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Petra, fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.86,0:12:56.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They've been turned into rocks!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.40,0:12:57.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.31,0:12:58.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,More Tokomon!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.28,0:13:04.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where are the rest of the children?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.60,0:13:05.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, we don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.02,0:13:11.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd do anything for a\Ngood moisturizing shampoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.22,0:13:21.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You little chickadees\Nthink you're so smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.04,0:13:26.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They won't get away that easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.24,0:13:40.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Kokatorimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.62,0:13:41.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that the Easter chicken?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.86,0:13:42.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's bad news!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.64,0:13:49.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That omelette head has Tai in Joe's chair!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.60,0:13:52.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I ran into several of your\Nfriends over by the pool,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.56,0:13:54.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but don't get your heads in a spin.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.64,0:13:56.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're just drying off.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.98,0:14:02.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing like little\Nsun-baked faces fried to a
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.46,0:14:05.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,crisp with curly corn\Nspuds and lots of coleslaw.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.42,0:14:07.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where are the Digimon?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.06,0:14:09.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about those guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.48,0:14:13.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Confidentially, I find them to be\Na little bit on the stiff side.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.18,0:14:16.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that just happens to\Nbe my personal opinion.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.56,0:14:17.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your opinion stinks.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.38,0:14:20.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you're going to meet the same fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.26,0:14:25.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've cackled once too often!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.38,0:14:26.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Spiral Twister!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.20,0:14:29.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Poison Ivy!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.38,0:14:34.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Petro!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.48,0:14:35.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.08,0:14:39.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come back, you chickens!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.58,0:14:42.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who's he calling chickens?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.98,0:14:50.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.14,0:14:57.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do we do now? We're trapped!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.08,0:15:01.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time to lock the plank!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.66,0:15:04.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Behemoth, do your stuff!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.06,0:15:05.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.06,0:15:07.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.10,0:15:13.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon, digital monsters,\NDigimon are the champions.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.22,0:15:17.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon, digital monsters,\NDigimon are the champions.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.96,0:15:28.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon, Digivolve, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.60,0:15:35.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Birdramon!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.78,0:15:37.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.78,0:15:42.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, that's not fair!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.50,0:15:45.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Meteor Wing!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.86,0:15:50.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the matter, you big cock?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.68,0:15:51.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't you fly?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.59,0:15:53.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Palmon, it's your turn! Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.94,0:15:56.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon! Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.32,0:16:01.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm Scared too!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.26,0:16:05.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pagumon!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.24,0:16:10.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Meteor wing!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.98,0:16:16.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Needle space!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.70,0:16:29.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, oh, oh, oh,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.62,0:16:36.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,oh, oh, oh, oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.68,0:16:37.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.59,0:16:38.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fried chicken.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.06,0:16:48.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.02,0:16:53.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't leave us all the way to go down.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.46,0:16:57.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I say we do the same as they\Nare in an abandoned ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.62,0:17:00.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess it's a little late\Nfor a mutiny. Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.20,0:17:03.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The captain's already been fricasseed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.02,0:17:05.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.72,0:17:12.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You may have ruffled my tail\Nfeathers, but I can still...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.32,0:17:20.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, so maybe I've lost a little bit\Nof my noodle, but I'm not finished yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.52,0:17:33.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, the weather sure\Nhasn't gotten any cooler.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.76,0:17:36.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you hear something?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.80,0:18:06.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's one man Tishamont with\Nhis feathers out of joint.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.66,0:18:15.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.32,0:18:17.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The giant cactus is back!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.22,0:18:18.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, not another mirage!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.92,0:18:20.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What were you expecting?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.24,0:18:21.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An outlet mall?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.50,0:18:22.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.41,0:18:23.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get over on the other side!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.46,0:18:38.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can fly! I can fly!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.02,0:18:40.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't fly!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.72,0:19:02.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.64,0:19:04.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's even bigger than a skyscraper!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.56,0:19:05.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.47,0:19:06.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's a skyscraper, Mimi?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.50,0:19:10.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look up there!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.86,0:19:12.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Check it out, you guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.60,0:19:28.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.00,0:19:30.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.34,0:19:33.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.64,0:19:34.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe it's a crest!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.20,0:19:39.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.16,0:20:09.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.50,0:20:10.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just like Gennai said.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.82,0:20:14.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The tags and crests somehow\Nwork together, Mimi. Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.98,0:20:18.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the crest of sincerity.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.02,0:20:24.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't deserve it, but if it'll help\Nme take care of Palmon, I'll keep it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.82,0:20:29.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.70,0:20:32.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Mimi.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.54,0:20:36.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I think I'm gonna have\Nto teach you some manners.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.30,0:20:38.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you know that you\Nslurp when you eat soup?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.62,0:20:41.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But don't worry, a single leaf\Non that pretty little head.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.74,0:20:45.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure, Mimi is sort of a Tetsuo, but\Nshe's really sincere and a good friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.78,0:20:48.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why she ended up\Nwith the Crest of Sincerity.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.12,0:20:51.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you ask me, that was a\Ngood call. Totally cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.08,0:21:28.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish you were here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.90,0:21:31.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please tell me right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.42,0:21:37.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't see all the\Nthings that you can't see.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.30,0:21:43.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so excited to.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.92,0:22:39.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's scary to evolve.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.22,0:22:43.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was a pain in the\Nheart of Agumon's heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.30,0:22:46.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can I get the courage and courage?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.30,0:22:50.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid of the people who\Nwere afraid of Piccolomon.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.80,0:22:53.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was a trip to the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.80,0:22:56.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Next time, Digimon Adventure!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.56,0:23:01.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, I'm going to evolve.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:00.39,0:23:03.44,Sign,,0,0,300,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}{\fad(300,0)}{\fs30\b1}The Fairy, Piccolomon!

